msgstr "Modules store state; routers organize calls"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:7
msgid "``EnvBase`` 模块描述世界的一部分，例如社交关系、天气或公共资源。一个实验可以挂载多个模块；智能体通过同一个环境入口使用它们。"
msgstr ""
"An ``EnvBase`` module describes one part of the world, such as social relationships, weather or "
"public resources. An experiment can mount multiple modules; agents access them through a single "
"environment entry point."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:9
msgid "智能体通过环境路由器调用多个环境模块的工具"
msgstr "Agents call tools in multiple environment modules through an environment router"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:27
msgid ""
"模块定义状态、工具和每步更新规则；``RouterBase`` 聚合工具、处理请求并返回结果。Ray 运行模式中的 ``EnvRouterProxy`` "
"连接智能体任务与共享的环境服务，避免每个智能体各自持有一份互不一致的世界状态。"
msgstr ""
"Modules define state, tools and step updates; ``RouterBase`` aggregates tools, handles requests "
"and returns results. In Ray mode, ``EnvRouterProxy`` connects agent tasks to a shared environment"
" service, keeping agents from holding inconsistent copies of world state."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:30
msgid "选择路由策略"
msgstr "Choosing a routing strategy"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:36
msgid "路由器"
msgstr "Router"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:37
msgid "调用方式"
msgstr "How calls are organized"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:38
msgid "``CodeGenRouter``"
msgstr "``CodeGenRouter``"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:39
msgid "生成代码来组合环境工具，适合需要多步查询、计算或批量操作的请求。"
msgstr ""
"Generates code to combine environment tools for requests involving multiple queries, calculations"
" or batch operations."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:40
msgid "``ReActRouter`` / ``PlanExecuteRouter``"
msgstr "``ReActRouter`` / ``PlanExecuteRouter``"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:41
msgid "通过工具决策循环，或先规划再执行，组织对模块工具的调用。"
msgstr ""
"Organizes module tool calls through a tool-decision loop or through planning followed by "
"execution."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:42
msgid "``TwoTierReActRouter`` / ``TwoTierPlanExecuteRouter``"
msgstr "``TwoTierReActRouter`` / ``TwoTierPlanExecuteRouter``"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:43
msgid "分层组织模块选择与工具执行，用于工具集合较大的环境。"
msgstr ""
"Organizes module selection and tool execution in separate tiers for environments with larger tool"
" collections."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:44
msgid "``SearchToolRouter``"
msgstr "``SearchToolRouter``"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:45
msgid "先检索相关工具，再组织调用。"
msgstr "Retrieves relevant tools before organizing calls."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:47
msgid ""
"先使用实验已有的策略，确认工具接口与结果可用后再比较其他路由器。代码执行后端、期限与模板复用见 :doc:`/codegen_execution`，系统执行模型见 "
":doc:`/architecture`。"
msgstr ""
"Begin with the strategy already configured for the experiment. Verify tool interfaces and results"
" before comparing routers. See :doc:`/codegen_execution` for execution backends, deadlines and "
"template reuse, and :doc:`/architecture` for the system execution model."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:50
msgid "查询、干预与时间推进"
msgstr "Queries, interventions and time advancement"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:52
msgid "**查询**：工具使用 ``readonly=True``；只读请求只允许查询类工具。"
msgstr "**Queries**: mark tools with ``readonly=True``; read-only requests can only call query tools."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:53
msgid "**干预**：修改资源、关系或规则的工具使用 ``readonly=False``；允许写入的请求才可调用。"
msgstr ""
"**Interventions**: mark tools that modify resources, relationships or rules with "
"``readonly=False``; only requests that allow writes can call them."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:54
msgid "**时间推进**：模块的 ``step(tick, t)`` 更新随时间变化的状态，工具调用本身不会替代实验时钟推进。"
msgstr ""
"**Time advancement**: module ``step(tick, t)`` methods update time-dependent state. Calling a "
"tool does not replace advancement of the experiment clock."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:56
msgid "只读限制取决于工具声明和实现是否一致。一个标记为只读的方法也应避免在内部修改实验状态。工具返回“已成功”之前，应完成必要的状态更新与输入校验。"
msgstr ""
"Read-only enforcement relies on declarations matching implementation. A read-only method should "
"also avoid modifying experiment state internally. Complete state updates and input validation "
"before returning a successful result."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:59
msgid "检查请求走到了哪里"
msgstr "Tracing where a request goes"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:61
msgid "先直接调用模块方法，确认输入和返回值；再挂载到路由器，检查工具是否被发现、只读属性是否正确。最后通过小规模实验检查智能体是否能使用工具，并核对 trace 与 replay 中的结果。"
msgstr ""
"Call module methods directly to verify inputs and return values, then mount the module on a "
"router and check tool discovery and read-only flags. Finally, use a small experiment to verify "
"agent access and inspect the trace and replay results."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/routing.rst:63
msgid "模块未出现时检查挂载列表和自定义模块扫描结果；工具未出现时检查 ``@tool``、类型注解与签名；结果能返回但恢复后丢失时，继续检查 :doc:`persistence`。"
msgstr ""
"If a module is missing, check the mount list and custom-module scan results. If a tool is "
"missing, check ``@tool``, annotations and signatures. If results disappear after restoration, "
"continue with :doc:`persistence`."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/tools.rst:86
msgid "``readonly=True`` 表示查询，``readonly=False`` 表示可能修改状态。``kind`` 控制工具是否参与自动观察或统计收集："
msgstr ""
"``readonly=True`` marks a query; ``readonly=False`` permits state changes. ``kind`` controls "
"whether the tool participates in automatic observation or statistics collection:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/tools.rst:88
msgid "``observe``：只读，除 ``self`` 外最多一个参数，用于按智能体收集观察。"
msgstr ""
"``observe``: read-only, with at most one parameter besides ``self``, for collecting observations "
"per agent."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/tools.rst:89
msgid "``statistics``：只读，除 ``self`` 外没有参数，用于收集整体统计。"
msgstr ""
"``statistics``: read-only, with no parameters besides ``self``, for collecting aggregate "
"statistics."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/tools.rst:90
msgid "未设置 ``kind``：常规工具，可以只读或读写，由路由器按请求调用。"
msgstr "No ``kind``: a regular tool, either read-only or writable, called by the router as requested."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/tools.rst:92
msgid "工具的类型注解和 docstring 用于生成调用说明。返回值应包含足够的信息，让智能体能够判断操作结果；缺少输入或操作失败时给出明确原因。"
msgstr ""
"Tool type annotations and docstrings provide call descriptions. Return enough information for the"
" agent to assess the result, including a clear reason when input is missing or an operation "
"fails."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/tools.rst:118
msgid "有关工具类型的更多详情，请参阅 :doc:`/concepts`。"
msgstr "See :doc:`/concepts` for more details on tool types."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/env_modules/tools.rst:194
msgid ""
"生产环境下环境路由跑在一个专用的 Ray actor 里（``EnvRouterProxy``），所有 agent 共享一份环境状态；也可在进程内直接用 "
"``CodeGenRouter``。除默认的 ``CodeGenRouter`` 外还有 ``ReActRouter`` / ``PlanExecuteRouter`` / "
"``TwoTierReActRouter`` / ``TwoTierPlanExecuteRouter`` / ``SearchToolRouter`` 可选（见 "
":doc:`/architecture`）。"
msgstr ""
"In production, environment routing runs in a dedicated Ray actor (``EnvRouterProxy``), and all "
"agents share the same environment state. ``CodeGenRouter`` can also be used directly in-process. "
"In addition to the default ``CodeGenRouter``, optional routers include ``ReActRouter``, "
"``PlanExecuteRouter``, ``TwoTierReActRouter``, ``TwoTierPlanExecuteRouter``, and "
"``SearchToolRouter`` (see :doc:`/architecture`)."
